 shurikens or blaze fiery Rocket  trails. Every upgrade combo creates harmonic chaos. Stack Cursed Curios, trigger evolutions, and rain explosive meteor storms on your enemies for devastating effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.poster.avif?t=1770240995\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.webm?t=1770240995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.mp4?t=1770240995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/b9da4bdfc56e749d6af7374929600888.avif?t=1770240995\" width=585 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still being developed, but we want to encourage everyone to participate! We have an active Discord server and would love to hear your feedback and questions!</p>","developers":["BitCake Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/de72b8f5d2b52cbb0ebabbbefd0b414fc7a933ef/header.jpg?t=1770240995","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2022 BitCake Studio. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1903560/900250643/8bed413c0c56978f44e56a134af3ac166f1d2172/1750797167/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750804694","dash_h264":"https:/